;   [GLOBAL] semua file config KECUALI kitty.conf & pixel scripts
;   [QML]    tuple Qt rgba(R/255, G/255, B/255, a)
;   [CSS]    tuple plain rgba(R, G, B, a) — waybar + hyprlock
;   [KITTY]  hanya config/kitty/kitty.conf (palet ANSI penuh)
;   [PIXEL]  hanya pixel_wave*.py (background video transisi)

